url: "https://github.com/lzbaclz/KVSalienceBench"
abstract: >
  Code for auditing KV-cache saliency predictors, with pooled and per-decision
  evaluation, attention-trace collection, a pinned masked-loop simulator,
  physical-KV reference validation, and correctness tests. External models
  and datasets are supplied separately.
keywords:
  - KV cache
  - attention prediction
  - empirical audit
  - physical validation
